  "note": "Pin → upstream UP. Upstream inserts 054 ProjectionThreadsAutoSettleDisabledAt, so OrchestrationV2 moves 54 → 55 and RemoveRedundantProjectionIndexes 55 → 56; 057–060 are appended. Upstream's own reconcileV2PreviewMigration renumbers a pin database (J5 snapshots it first). Every file hash changed because upstream renamed the effect/unstable/sql imports to effect/sql; no migration's SQL changed, and the V2 pieces differ only in a comment. 050's PR-backfill helpers changed again (ssh remote hostnames without the port, a null-host guard); a recorded 050 is never rerun.",
